id           = CWE-1063
name         = Creation of Class Instance within a Static Code Block
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Incomplete

description : A static code block creates an instance of a class.

extended description : This pattern identifies situations where a storable data element or member data element is initialized with a value in a block of code which is declared as static.

notes : https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1063.html
